<title>HONG KONG: Easyknit interim net rises 19.32 pct.</title>
<headline>Easyknit interim net rises 19.32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 14.01  vs 14.91</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  2.0    vs 7.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  55.50  vs 46.51</p>
<p>    Turnover		   627.80 vs 601.61</p>
<p>    Company name	     Easyknit International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		December 16-20, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 January 8, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Easyknit International is a clothing exporter.</p>
<p>Earnings per share is calculated on the basis of the weighted average of 396.07 million shares versus 312.00 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
